   <media:description>THE BEST SUPPORT IS A LIKE AND SUBSCRIBE-BOTH ARE FREE 

MERCH CLOTHING AND GEAR  available at HAYDENCANTRELLE.COM

In this video I take you guys back into some season action here in 2026. After a nice offseason break and recharge, the 5GUY fam is back. In this video I take you into the travel into Arizona for Spring Training as we get back into the swing of things. 
I worked on some adjustments in the box and defensively in the offseason-so Im excited to see what this summer has in store. 
We had opening day in Des Moines and started our season with a roadtrip to Louisville. 
I show some pregame, live action gameplay and postgames.
Eating at my favorite spots here in town, and getting ready for the marathon. 

Also taking sometime to give a glimpse into what travel is like at the AAA level, some early morning flights and the good ole grind-ENJOY


